        <a class="blog-menu__item" href="#worked-example" onclick="location.hash='worked-example'; return false;">A worked example: mapping one entity</a>
        <a class="blog-menu__item" href="#diagnostic" onclick="location.hash='diagnostic'; return false;">Entity diagnostic: weak vs stronger signals</a>
